  "conclusion": "No pre-authentication EID oracle. InitiateAuthentication carries no EID field, so an unauthenticated caller has no input to enumerate over; eventEntries are returned only by AuthenticateClient, which requires an eUICC-signed response embedding CERT.EUICC (the EID). You can only learn 'event waiting vs nothing' for an EID whose eUICC you control."
